      "updated": 1791510030471,
      "created": 1791507657378,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "H(B/A) = p(a)·H(B/a) + p(e)·H(B/e) + p(i)·H(B/i) + p(o)·H(B/o) + p(u)·H(B/u)\n\nH(B/A) = 7/30 * 2,2359 + 4/30 * 1.5 + 5/30 * 1.5219  + 9/30 * 1.65777  + 5/30 * 1.3710 = 1,7012 bit/simbolo\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "H(B/A) = p(a)·H(B/a) + p(e)·H(B/e) + p(i)·H(B/i) + p(o)·H(B/o) + p(u)·H(B/u)\n\nH(B/A) = 7/30 * 2,2359 + 4/30 * 1.5 + 5/30 * 1.5219  + 9/30 * 1.65777  + 5/30 * 1.3710 = 1,7012 bit/simbolo\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
