      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "H_r(S) = −Σ pᵢ · log3(pᵢ) = 2*(1/3 * log3(3)) + 2*(1/9 * log3(9)) + 3*(1/27 * log3(27)) = 1.44 bits/simbolo",
